[32m╭─ Claude ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│[39m I drafted three purchase orders, one per supplier, for Amudha to check and send. I sized each    [32m│
│[39m order to bring stock up to two weeks of normal use. All three are well under the Rs. 25,000      [32m│
│[39m limit.                                                                                           [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m | Supplier | Items | Total |                                                                     [32m│
│[39m |---|---|---|                                                                                    [32m│
│[39m | Sundar Traders | maida 22 kg | Rs. 1,012 |                                                     [32m│
│[39m | Fresh Dairy Supplies | butter 10 kg, fresh cream 3 L, eggs 7 trays | Rs. 7,550 |               [32m│
│[39m | Green Leaf Bakery Supplies | cocoa powder 0.9 kg | Rs. 648 |                                   [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m The three orders come to Rs. 9,210 in total.                                                     [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m - **Below reorder level:** maida, butter and cocoa powder.                                       [32m│
│[39m - **Under two weeks of use:** fresh cream and eggs. They are above their reorder levels but      [32m│
│[39m wouldn't last two weeks.                                                                         [32m│
│[39m - **No order needed:** sugar, cake boxes and walnuts have enough stock.                          [32m│
│[39m - **Eggs:** the reorder rules don't name a supplier for eggs. I used Fresh Dairy Supplies        [32m│
│[39m because the stock list shows them as the supplier.                                               [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
